---
interface Props {
  postCount: number;
  tagCount: number;
  latestYear: number;
}

const { postCount, tagCount, latestYear } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="profile-card bento-card" aria-labelledby="profile-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">PERSONAL NOTES</p>
  <h1 id="profile-title">把问题写清楚，<br />也把答案留下来。</h1>
  <p>
    这里记录 Web 开发、PHP、Linux 与日常工程实践。文章保持静态、开放，并尽量让旧链接继续可用。
  </p>
  <div class="profile-actions">
    <a class="button button-primary" href="#articles">浏览文章</a>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="/about">了解本站</a>
  </div>
</section>

<aside class="stats-card bento-card" aria-label="站点统计">
  <p class="eyebrow">ARCHIVE</p>
  <dl class="stats-grid">
    <div>
      <dt>文章</dt>
      <dd>{postCount}</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>标签</dt>
      <dd>{tagCount}</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt>更新至</dt>
      <dd>{latestYear}</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
  <p class="stats-note">全部正文在构建时生成 HTML，阅读无需客户端请求 Markdown。</p>
</aside>
